  "$comment": [
    "Frozen, SHRINK-ONLY migration-ledger divergence, keyed by Supabase project ref.",
    "Read scripts/check-migration-ledger.mjs before touching this file.",
    "",
    "localOnly  = a file in supabase/migrations/ with no row in that project's ledger.",
    "             `supabase db push` believes it is pending and will REPLAY it.",
    "ledgerOnly = a ledger row with no local file. The repo cannot reproduce the",
    "             database: a fresh environment would be missing whatever it applied.",
    "",
    "A version not listed here FAILS the check, so a new migration \u2014 which is by",
    "definition not listed \u2014 must be at parity on every project. Entries only ever",
    "come OUT: a version that reaches parity must be removed, and a stale entry is",
    "itself a failure. Never add one to silence a build.",
    "",
    "contentDrift = a version present BOTH locally and in the ledger whose SQL differs.",
    "             The version matches, so the two lists above are clean while the file",
    "             and the database disagree about what the migration contains.",
    "             Comments and whitespace are normalized away before comparing, so every",
    "             entry is a real difference in DDL. Seeded 2026-08-15 at 25 entries on",
    "             production; shrink-only like the other two."
